@startuml
!include style.puml
title SD04b — F08 proposal, confirmation, Observer and contingency
boundary "PlanUpdatesPanel / EventPlanningCLI" as V
control EventPlanningController as C
control EventPlanningFacade as F
participant AdaptivePlanningService as S
entity Event as E
participant "taskService / scheduleService / budgetService\n(each implements EventObserver)" as O
participant EventPlanningAgent as A
V -> C : proposeChangeFields(eventId, fields)
C -> F : proposeChangeFields(eventId, fields)
F -> F : observed(eventId)
F -> E : addObserver(service) [each service]
F -> S : proposeFields(event, fields)
S -> S : checked(event, fields)
note over S : Validate isolated snapshot; store pending PlanChange with before fields
ref over F : SD07 save pending proposal; real event facts unchanged
note over V,S
  CLI natural alternative: proposeChange -> adaptive.propose -> interpret.
  GUI preview obtains fields from SD04a.
end note
V -> C : confirmChange(eventId, confirmed)
C -> F : confirmChange(eventId, confirmed)
F -> S : confirm(observed(eventId), confirmed)
alt confirmed == false
  note over S : Remove pending proposal; leave real event unchanged
else confirmed == true and before fields stale
  S --> F : IllegalArgumentException; propose again
else confirmed == true and proposal current
  S -> E : applyChanges(changes)
  note over E : Validate candidate snapshot; assign facts; reset communication approvals
  loop Each registered service
    E -> O : onEventChanged(event, changedFields)
    O -> E : flagReview(component, issues) [if retained plan exists]
  end
  note over S : Remove pending proposal
end
ref over F : SD07 save meaningful resulting state; save failure restores before
V -> C : generateContingency(eventId, risk)
C -> F : generateContingency(eventId, risk)
F -> S : contingency(event, risk)
S -> A : milestoneOutput(contingency instruction, context)
A --> S : recommendation JSON
S -> E : addContingency(plan)
ref over F : SD07 persist recommendation
F --> V : unverified contingency (through controller)
note over V,E
  No weather tool, forecast call, supplier check or automatic contingency application.
  GUI cancel-dialog alone makes no call; proposal remains pending.
  CLI negative confirmation calls false and removes pending proposal.
end note
@enduml
